pbwinput 1
# From power-on through the start menu's NEW GAME and the whole intro (overlay 294) to the field's first script
# (port/cmake/app.cmake's replay_new_game): Professor Juniper's talk, the player's sex and name, the rival's name,
# then the season banner and the opening's 3D flight over Aspertia City, which fades out at video frame 12,060.
# A once a second through the talk and both name entries, which take it as letters: the names come out AAAAAAA and
# HughAAA. Video frames, as start_menu.pbwinput, which this starts as
version b2_us
frames video
